st\u2026 how far can you get before the monsters catch you?\n\nDo you have what it takes to escape Vault 53?", "short_description": "Step into the dark corridors of Vault 53, a VR survival horror experience where every shadow hides a threat. Trapped deep underground, your only hope is to navigate through shifting levels, solve environmental challenges, and flee from the monsters that stalk the vault.\n\nEscape the Vault \u2013 Each level is a maze of danger, with new paths and obstacles standing between you and freedom.\n\nRun, Hide, Survive \u2013 You\u2019re being hunted. Outwit and outrun terrifying creatures that patrol the halls.\n\nImmersiv"}]}, "developer_name": "Universal", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://universal790132.wixsite.com/my-site-10", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "unIversal", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://universal790132.wixsite.com/my-site-10", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "31100175422959271"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_1727692024549586_4851237156289960006_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4qsZaY6lvREQ7kNvwE7Z1_S&_nc_oc=AdrloBSaQZhS8KDkZgdrVBfTQSas1hME